    "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The perimeter of an equilateral triangle is <math alttext=\"624\"><mn>624</mn></math> centimeters. The height of this triangle is <math alttext=\"k StartRoot 3 EndRoot\"><mi>k</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math> centimeters, where <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi></math> is a constant. What is the value of <math alttext=\"k\"><mi>k</mi></math>?</p>",
    "type": "grid-in",
